It is morning now.
The sunlight is very warm.
I am standing at the bus stop.
This is near my home.
There is a lot of traffic on the road.
Many vehicles are passing by.
Today I have a journey in the city.
First, I need to go to the metro station.
Therefore, I am waiting for the bus.
I need to get on the bus.
Some other people are also standing here.
I look at my watch.
The time is nine o'clock.
A bus is coming from afar.
But that is not my bus.
I wait again.
